1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,000
In this world, magic is everything.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Asta and Yuna were abandoned together as infants at a church in the remote village of Hajj.

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Determined not to be held back by their status as commoners, both do their utmost to realize their shared dream of becoming the ultimate mage, the Wizard King.

7
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
In their 15th year, the two boys received their grimoires, special books that will enhance their magic.

8
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
They then set off to take the Magic Knight's entrance exam, in hopes of joining one of the Wizard King's famed squads.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
We'll fight to see who will be the Wizard King, whatever it takes!

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:17,000
After an exceptional performance on the exam, Magically Gifted Yuno has his pick of the nine squads and elects to join the elite Golden Dawn.

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Meanwhile, Magicless Asta is inducted into the Black Bulls, widely regarded as a squad of misfits.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,000
I won't give up! I will become the Wizard King!

13
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:38,000
And so, the two young men have taken the first step toward achieving their dream of becoming the Wizard King.

14
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Shaking? What's going on? Is this an earthquake?

15
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,000
I mean, is this an earthquake?

16
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Oh, what the...

17
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,000
What the hell is that?!

18
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Sorry to interrupt, but there's urgent news, sir!

19
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:36,000
We have a situation on our hands, yes?

20
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Calm down, Marks. The timing couldn't be more perfect. I know just who to give this mission to.

21
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Who, sir?

22
00:02:45,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Alright.

23
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
I just got off.

24
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:09,000
I'm住んで, guys, by losing someone.

25
