Oh

28
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:28,460
Come on, Magna. It's far with me. No holding back. No way battle freak

29
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:37,280
Please you know you wanna. Let's go. I'll eat your flan again if I have to you better keep your grubby little hands away from my food

30
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,280
Okay

31
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:41,280
Not happening

32
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:43,280
Oh, you big tease

33
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:45,280
How about Silvante Schnauzer?

34
